["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI开源、亚马逊新动作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWbXr0EmbCnVlAiw7xIvuYsgtxC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底层战争已结束，垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底层大模型是年轻人借微软算力做出的涌现，但真正赚钱的行业副驾驶属于创业老兵——三分之二的垂直机会已被ChatGPT自己干掉，剩下的是数据、社交和商业模式的组合战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前记者空降巴西，她的拉美商业游记 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQ-nhLnqkTMm8pY3xNQqcz_cb_n.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中国，但中间公司活不下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的税收和劳工法让大公司和小团队都能活，唯独中间规模的公司被夹死；政治左右摇摆本身是确定的，创业者把它当成可控制的变量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷银行危机未结束：未来风险传导的3个可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1kKnPtJWMzDCIstwB9k7krx12a.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷银行倒闭：美联储只保存款人，不保股东</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储做了一个黑白分明的决定：三万户机构存款人全额保护，股东血本无归。这不是雷曼时刻，而是一个时间差——但美国信誉的慢性下滑可能才刚开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷银行</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"6. 显微镜下的硅谷大裁员：一笔笔现实经济账 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhc35VOmgPTfIMmG3h6NJdwkPlfZ.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁员补偿 4+N/2：有绿卡是幸福，没绿卡是倒计时</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一场 Meta 裁员，有绿卡的人拿着十几万美金去新公司上班，没绿卡的人要在四个月内、还是节假日窗口里找到下一份工作，否则就得离开美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁员</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航员与机器人：漫谈深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqx2soYz782O4451-l7klWL-MdkO.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>让机器人削个土豆就能当院士，这比登火星更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技术人类大部分已经有了，只是个经济问题；但怎么让机器人在厨房里工作，人类现在还不知道，甚至还没有思路——谁能让机器人削个土豆，可以当院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊马斯克、机器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frwlq1h1luJuh--l7ns3xS7_zVUT.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形机器人最难的环节不是走路，是穿针剥虾</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">双足行走和自主导航都能沿袭特斯拉自动驾驶的积累，精准力控和触觉不能——那要模拟人的皮肤，开车时根本用不到。第一版、第二版机器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"1. 和投资人梦秋聊聊加州、投资寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持币待购\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohANge6xUKNJYHcFrR36QdyZQbQ.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>资本寒冬不是缺钱，是大家都在持币待购</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「资本寒冬」每两三年就被喊一次，通常六到八个月就过去。这次不一样：两头在外的美元通路被打断，不是没钱，而是不知道该怎么投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">资本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"串台《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成长起来？ UP 值 UG 中台 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuG7h07tc_--MRpcmkfgLxmZb9-O.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下长大，靠的不是产品而是体系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节赢在体系而非个人：推荐算法、UG 中台、商业化三套系统叠加 Musical.ly 的产品壳，再用对标 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsmh-73nZbOXpxwKYaADw0enBwmo.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空档全面压制：TikTok 花 100 亿美元砸出护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是钱和一条暗号：几年间投入约 100 亿美元买量、补贴内容、砸服务器，对手要拦至少得准备 200 到 300 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字节跳动</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvE4x_Rk5GG8jF_tneNLXgpuXTy5.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊贵的客户，直到日活破亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推广预算每个季度增长 100% 以上；Facebook 认定它留存太差、留不住用户，反而把流量导给它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]